Hello guys! How are you doing?

The 1.3.1 update fixes joystick issues:

[list]
[*] Improved overall joysticks usability;
[*] Fixed bugs that prevented Xbox joysticks from being recognized;
[*] PS4 joysticks are now compatible;
[*] Nintendo Switch Pro controllers are now compatible;
[*] Upgrades are now limitless, with the exception of the attack speed upgrades which depends of the current equipped weapon;
[*] Fixed a user interface bug in the secret character unlock process;
[*] Bug fixes and improvements.
[/list]

We apologize for any inconvenience caused and for the delay to fixing such critical issues. We hope your joystick can now be a surprise weapon in this pigeon invasion.

Thank you for your attention and patience!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32265385/de0a86bad078745a4570227e91234e1832bf31c0.png[/img]

Hello guys! How are you doing?

After a long wait, we have finally set an agreement with the International Pigeons Association to release a new update for Pigeons Attack! 

[b]Check it out a brief explanation of what is new:[/b]

[list]
[*] User Interface completely remade and improved;
[*] Visual improvement of the main menu;
[*] Added skins to the game;
[*] New multiplayer lobby;
[*] The dash ability doesn’t require a rune anymore;
[*] Added new configs in the Options menu;
[*] Added French as a new supported language (thank you Jessy);
[*] Added Dutch as a new supported language (thank you Casper Vermeeren);
[*] Added Hungarian as a new supported language (thank you Czeiner András);
[*] Reduced the time of the splashed screen caused by the white pigeon;
[*] Leaderboard now accepts high scores made in co op matches;
[*] Fixed a bug that prevented some enemies to reach the player’s position, causing the round not to end.
[/list]


[h1]Skins[/h1]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32265385/d2b64f579ecdef1e077978f97e74a2b422ce7891.png[/img]

Nothing better than putting a new cool clothing on and make the pigeons jealous of you during the war. Save your coins and buy skins to customize your hero, maybe this could even be a tactic to confuse your enemies. We will keep releasing new skins throughout the updates.


[h1]New User Interface[/h1]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32265385/9174ebee56c9b9f31e290076f47602e09a3fa539.png[/img]

You can now look at the UI without feeling angry about it. In the previous versions, it looked more like an enemy pigeon that stands in your way of seeing the game. The user interface is prettier, more intuitive and with better transitions.


[h1]Options Menu[/h1]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32265385/fd5b8fe8aa4dc3003ce5fb5c469cdafa7a70c9fd.png[/img]

Besides improving its visual, we have added new options so you can customize your war against the evil pigeons:

[b]General[/b]
[list]
[*] Master volume slider;
[/list]

[b]Video[/b]
[list]
[*] Textures quality;
[*] Shadows quality
[*] Anti-aliasing quality and mode;
[*] Post Processing options;
[*] Vegetation quality.
[/list]

[b]Controls[/b]
[list]
[*] Crosshair’s size and color;
[*] Confine or not cursor’s movement to the game window;
[*] Toggle assisted aim while playing with joysticks.
[/list]

[h1]New Lobby[/h1]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32265385/1e7c5ec71b726a4481b1a285cf8cd0c512b6e58a.png[/img]

The lobby is now a cozy place. You and your friends will have the opportunity to share a table in the most famous tavern from Almerath. It’s the moment you waited for laughing at your friends face for losing in a dumb way in the previous match and to show off the skins you have bought.
Now you don’t need to invite again your friends after a custom match. Everyone will get back to the lobby, where you will have the option to change character, map, runes, skins and start a new fight.


[h1]Novos idiomas[/h1]

Pigeons are getting smarter. Now they know how to speak in French, Dutch and Hungarian, thanks to the amazing support of the players Jessy, Casper Vermeeren e Czeiner András who taught them the respective languages. 


[h1]Thank you very much![/h1]

We are sorry for taking so long to release a new update. We are very grateful for your patience, for all the support and for trying to stop the pigeon’s domination


Thank you for your attention!

